I'm definitely going to go on a diet.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:50.920
I'm only going to eat salad for dinner.

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.290
Don't bother, eat whatever you like.

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:55.450
It's not healthy to hold back.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.920
But...

00:16:56.920 --> 00:16:59.760
Then, maybe I'll have a pork
shabu-shabu salad.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:01.090
Pork?

00:17:01.090 --> 00:17:07.050
The cutlet you made with several slices
of pork was really delicious.

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:09.730
I won't eat deep fried foods!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.610
It might be good if I fried it with ginger-slices.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.870
That sounds delicious.

00:17:14.870 --> 00:17:17.240
I'm getting kind of hungry.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:19.680
Well, it's about dinner time.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.980
Let's head back to our rooms for dinner.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:24.150
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:29.260
Hiro, if you ever feel like you
can't eat any more,

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:32.290
I'll be in Room 202.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:35.160
I'm going to try not to make too much.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:37.130
It would be bad if I ate too much.

00:17:37.630 --> 00:17:38.130
I hear it's good to chew well and eat slowly.

00:17:38.130 --> 00:17:38.900
Wiiiir...
I hear it's good to chew well and eat slowly.

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:40.400
I hear it's good to chew well and eat slowly.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:40.530
Wiiiir...
wiiiir...
I hear it's good to chew well and eat slowly.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.170
Wiiiir...
wiiiir...
How many times should I chew for each bite?

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:42.540
How many times should I chew for each bite?

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:42.700
Wiiir...
wiiir...
wiiir...
wiiir...
How many times should I chew for each bite?

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:43.260
Wiiir...
wiiir...
wiiir...
wiiir...

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:46.870
What's that sound?

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.470
What's wrong, Yunocchi?

00:17:48.470 --> 00:17:52.240
I hear a strange sound.

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.870
Huh?

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:56.820
Indeed...

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:59.150
But no one lives in 203.

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:00.590
That's right.

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:02.380
It's been an empty room all this time.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:10.360
I feel as if I exercised quite a bit.

00:18:12.060 --> 00:18:15.860
I shouldn't have given up. I should have
tried to keep it up just a little longer.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.770
I wound up smoking!

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:21.430
Well, I guess I'll try my best tomorrow.

00:18:22.780 --> 00:18:23.980
Sae?

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.600
Yeah...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:31.180
It's all right!

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:36.620
It's made this sound ever since I lived here.

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:40.750
Huh? Hiro, did you live in Room 203?

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:44.860
Hiro, are you still doing that?

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.700
What is it? Is there something there?

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:50.000
I-It's nothing.

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:52.910
Anyway, I'm opening it up.

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.530
What?!

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:57.200
Don't!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.880
Hiro?

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.250
Hey!

00:19:10.690 --> 00:19:12.420
Hello...

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.530
I came to pick them up.

00:19:14.530 --> 00:19:16.860
Were there always this many?

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:18.760
Perhaps I'll take them some other time.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.630
I don't mind.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:24.100
All right, then I guess I'll come
back some other time.

00:19:25.040 --> 00:19:26.830
Landlady, lock the door!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.440
Should I lock it?

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.570
Yes, please.

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:35.410
See you later!

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.990
What was that all about?!

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.790
It's nothing, nothing at all!

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:45.260
Say, Hiro...

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:46.860
Umm, was someone here?
Say, Hiro...

00:19:46.860 --> 00:19:48.130
Umm, was someone here?
I don't know anything!

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:48.530
It was the landlady.
I don't know anything!

00:19:48.530 --> 00:19:49.030
It was the landlady.
Come on...

00:19:49.030 --> 00:19:50.230
It was the landlady.
I don't know!

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:53.270
Come on, come on, Hiro!

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:56.200
What are Hiro and Miya-chan doing?

00:19:56.200 --> 00:19:59.510
I don't think it's anything important.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.910
Those are those diet things, aren't they?

00:20:01.910 --> 00:20:03.700
They're for diets, right?

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:05.980
There was one like this...

00:20:05.980 --> 00:20:08.740
And one like this...

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.720
Stop...

00:20:10.720 --> 00:20:14.220
I see you were living in Room 203.

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.420
Did those things come with the room?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.560
Of course not!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.360
Then, are they yours?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.400
No, the landlady brought them.

00:20:23.400 --> 00:20:24.660
All of them?

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.770
It was one by one.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:29.670
She asked me whether I wanted to test
them out as a part-time job.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:31.740
Oh? The part-time job diet...

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:33.240
I'm not doing it anymore,

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:36.370
but the landlady won't take them off my hands.

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:39.080
So, did they work?

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.880
You tried so many of them,
one of them must have.

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:45.050
Oh my...

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:47.990
That's why I didn't want to say anything!

00:20:47.990 --> 00:20:50.390
Miya-chan, please keep quiet about this!

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.860
Please don't say anything!

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.260
You want me to keep quiet?

00:20:59.260 --> 00:21:00.890
Yeah!

00:21:01.670 --> 00:21:03.740
They'll tell us sooner or later.

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.860
Both of them are bad at keeping secrets.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.950
The sponsors of the International Bobsled
Competition that was held today

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:17.720
stubbornly refused to end the event...

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.320
Today sure was a strange day.

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.190
A lot happened.

00:21:22.190 --> 00:21:22.320
International Bobsled Competition Called Off
A lot happened.

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.250
International Bobsled Competition Called Off

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:41.300
Is it really impossible for me
to leave until morning?

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.280
Huh?

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.400
Miya-chan!

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.950
Sorry...

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:53.550
It's all right.

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:56.590
I'll stay with you until you fall asleep.

00:21:56.590 --> 00:21:58.220
Thank you.

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:04.060
Outside of the window...

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:07.000
I look up towards the blue sky...

00:22:07.000 --> 00:22:08.070
The End
To Be Continued
