The record of a resounding shooting star

00:23:00.620 --> 00:23:03.960
Your singing voice

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:07.030
Touches my heart

00:23:07.030 --> 00:23:10.300
A sky full of shooting stars

00:23:10.300 --> 00:23:13.430
The record of a shining shooting star

00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:16.640
Your whispering voice

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.070
Leads me through space

00:23:20.070 --> 00:23:22.940
A song about shooting stars

00:23:22.940 --> 00:23:26.480
I can't hear them

00:23:26.480 --> 00:23:30.420
I can't reach them

00:23:30.420 --> 00:23:34.980
