Preview
Tell me all the things you don't
want to remember!

00:23:43.490 --> 00:23:44.320
Preview
Okay!

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:46.730
Preview
Just recently, I lost my only 500 yen coin.

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.960
Preview
I feel like crying thinking about it even now!

00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:50.400
Preview
One time I got the hives.

00:23:50.400 --> 00:23:52.930
Preview
I was really shocked when my face swelled up.

00:23:52.930 --> 00:23:55.430
Preview
I don't want to remember
anything about scales.

00:23:55.430 --> 00:23:57.040
Preview
Mine is...

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:58.170
Preview
I don't want to say what it is.

00:23:58.170 --> 00:24:00.870
Preview
What?! That's not fair!

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:03.040
Preview
I-It's a delicate issue.

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:03.380
Preview

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:06.510
Preview
The next episode is "July 7, No Peeking"

00:24:06.510 --> 00:24:07.950
Preview
